 "{inUse} thing is in {name}. Pick where they go, and {name2} is removed once they have moved.": "Hay {inUse} cosa en {name}. Elige a dónde van, y {name2} se quita cuando se hayan movido.",
 "{inUse} things are in {name}. Pick where it goes, and {name2} is removed once it has moved.": "Hay {inUse} cosas en {name}. Elige a dónde va, y {name2} se quita cuando se haya movido.",
 "{inUse} things are in {name}. Pick where it goes, and {name2} is removed once they have moved.": "Hay {inUse} cosas en {name}. Elige a dónde va, y {name2} se quita cuando se hayan movido.",
 "{inUse} things are in {name}. Pick where they go, and {name2} is removed once it has moved.": "Hay {inUse} cosas en {name}. Elige a dónde van, y {name2} se quita cuando se haya movido.",
 "{inUse} things are in {name}. Pick where they go, and {name2} is removed once they have moved.": "Hay {inUse} cosas en {name}. Elige a dónde van, y {name2} se quita cuando se hayan movido.",
 "Anyone can take this": "Cualquiera puede hacerlo",
 "Yours": "Tuyo",
 "Nothing due or coming due fits in {minutes} minutes.": "Nada de lo que toca o está por tocar cabe en {minutes} minutos.",
 "{length} things fit, and all of them together take {togetherMinutes} minutes.": "Caben {length} cosas, y todas juntas toman {togetherMinutes} minutos.",
 "{length} things fit on their own. The first {togetherCount} together take {togetherMinutes} minutes.": "Caben {length} cosas por separado. Las primeras {togetherCount} juntas toman {togetherMinutes} minutos.",
 "{length} has no time written down, so it is left out rather than guessed at. Add how long it takes and {value} can be offered.": "{length} no tiene tiempo anotado, así que se deja fuera en lugar de adivinarlo. Agrega cuánto tarda y se puede ofrecer {value}.",
